{
  "unitId": "ch07-s02",
  "chapterId": "ch07",
  "versionId": "ch07-s02-v1",
  "title": "产品价值怎样分布在产品的各个部分中",
  "html": "<p>现在回到资本家怎样把货币变成资本的例子。纺纱工人的必要劳动是 6 小时，剩余劳动也是 6 小时，所以劳动力的剥削程度为 100%。</p>\n<p>12 小时工作日生产出 20 磅纱，价值 30 先令。其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8/10</span></span></span></span>，即 24 先令，只是被消耗的生产资料价值重新出现在纱中：20 磅棉花值 20 先令，纺锭等生产资料的损耗值 4 先令。这部分是不变资本。其余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/10</span></span></span></span>，即 6 先令，是纺纱过程中创造的新价值。其中一半补回预付的劳动力日价值，也就是 3 先令可变资本，另一半则是 3 先令剩余价值。因此，20 磅纱的总价值由下面三部分组成：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>纱的价值 </mtext><mn>30</mn><mtext> 先令</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{纱的价值 }30\\text{ 先令}=24c+3v+3m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">纱的价值</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">先令</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>这 30 先令总价值体现在全部 20 磅纱中。因此，构成总价值的三个部分，也都可以用相应数量的纱来表示。</p>\n<p>既然 30 先令体现在 20 磅纱中，那么总价值的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8/10</span></span></span></span>，即 24 先令不变资本，就体现在产品的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8/10</span></span></span></span>，也就是 16 磅纱中。这 16 磅又可分为两部分：其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅代表棉花的 20 先令价值，另外 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅代表所消耗的辅助材料和纺锭等劳动工具的 4 先令价值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱可以代表生产 20 磅纱所用的全部棉花价值，而且只代表棉花价值。这些纱实际只含有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅棉花，棉花本身值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 先令。但它们的总价值还多出 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 先令，这正好补上其余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱中所含棉花的价值。计算时，就好像把后面那些纱里的棉花全部抽出来，塞进了前面的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱。这样一来，这部分纱就不再代表辅助材料和劳动工具的价值，也不代表纺纱过程中创造的新价值。</p>\n<p>同样，另外 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱所含的 4 先令价值，可以代表其余不变资本，而且只代表生产全部 20 磅纱时消耗的辅助材料和劳动工具的价值。</p>\n<p>这样，产品的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8/10</span></span></span></span>，即 16 磅纱，就代表了全部不变资本。从实物和用途上看，这 16 磅纱当然同剩下的纱一样，都是纺纱劳动生产出来的。但在这里的价值分解中，它们不代表本次纺纱劳动新创造的任何价值。仿佛它们没有经过纺纱就自己变成了纱，纱的外表只是一层伪装。资本家把这 16 磅纱卖掉，得到 24 先令，再用这笔钱买回生产资料时，这层关系就很清楚了：这 16 磅纱不过是披着纱的外衣的棉花、纺锭、煤等生产资料。</p>\n<p>反过来，剩下的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/10</span></span></span></span>，即 4 磅纱，现在只代表 12 小时纺纱过程中创造的 6 先令新价值。这 4 磅纱原本包含的原料和劳动工具价值，已经从计算中抽出来，全部归入前面的 16 磅纱。凝结在全部 20 磅纱中的新纺纱劳动，现在集中体现在这 4 磅纱上。仿佛工人是在空气中纺出了它们，或者使用了天然存在、不需要人类劳动生产，因而也不向产品转移任何价值的棉花和纺锭。</p>\n<p>这 4 磅纱代表当天纺纱过程创造的全部新价值。其中一半，即 2 磅纱，只代表补回已消耗劳动力的 3 先令价值，也就是可变资本。另一半，即另外 2 磅纱，只代表 3 先令剩余价值。</p>\n<p>纺纱工的 12 小时劳动创造了 6 先令新价值，所以，价值 30 先令的 20 磅纱总共体现了 60 小时劳动。其中，16 磅纱代表生产资料中已有的 48 小时过去劳动；另外 4 磅纱代表纺纱过程中付出的 12 小时新劳动。</p>\n<p>前面已经讲过，棉纱的价值由两部分相加而成：一部分是纺纱过程创造的新价值，另一部分是生产资料原有的价值。现在我们又看到，这些作用不同的价值成分，还可以分别用产品中相应数量的棉纱来表示。</p>\n<p>这样，全部产品就可以分成三部分。第一部分只代表生产资料中已有的劳动，也就是不变资本；第二部分只代表生产过程中增加的必要劳动，也就是可变资本；最后一部分只代表同一过程中增加的剩余劳动，也就是剩余价值。这种分法既简单又重要，后面把它用来分析更复杂、尚未解决的问题时，我们会看得更清楚。</p>\n<p>刚才，我们把全部产品看成 12 小时工作日结束后的成品。我们也可以顺着它的生产过程来考察，看看这几部分产品怎样先后形成，同时仍用它们分别表示作用不同的价值成分。</p>\n<p>纺纱工 12 小时生产 20 磅纱，平均每小时生产 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅。因此，前 8 小时生产的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱，价值正好等于全天所用棉花的总价值。随后 1 小时 36 分钟生产的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 磅纱，代表 12 小时内耗费的其他劳动工具的价值。再用 1 小时 12 分钟生产 2 磅纱，价值 3 先令，正好等于 6 小时必要劳动创造的新价值。最后 1 小时 12 分钟也生产 2 磅纱，它的价值等于工人半天的剩余劳动创造的剩余价值。英国工厂主平时就这样计算，例如会说，工作日的前 8 小时，也就是三分之二的时间，是在“挣回棉花”。这种算法本身没有错。它只是把成品中并列存在的各个部分，改写成了生产过程中前后相继的时间段。</p>\n<p>可是，这种算法很容易让人产生一种极其荒谬的理解。那些既从价值增殖中获得实际利益，又有意在理论上误解它的人，尤其容易这样想。他们会以为，纺纱工在前 8 小时创造或补回棉花的价值，在随后 1 小时 36 分钟创造或补回其他劳动工具的价值，再用 1 小时 12 分钟补回工资，只有那著名的“最后一小时”才替工厂主生产剩余价值。</p>\n<p>这样一来，纺纱工就要同时完成两个奇迹。第一，他一边用棉花、纺锭、蒸汽机、煤和油来纺纱，一边又把这些东西生产出来。第二，他把一个工作日变成了五个同样长、同样强度的工作日。在这个例子中，生产原料和其他劳动工具所需的劳动，相当于四个 12 小时工作日，因为它们的价值是 24 先令，而每个 12 小时工作日只创造 6 先令新价值；把这些东西变成棉纱，又需要一个 12 小时工作日。接下来这个著名的历史实例会说明，贪欲怎样相信这种奇迹，迎合它的理论家又怎样替它作证。</p>\n"
}
